      }
    },
    "text": "Love the local-first approach. Have you talked with a refill shop about their busiest customer questions?",
    "userId": "75f9826a-1f3a-42ef-95c1-7b602722baeb"
  },
  {
    "_id": {
      "$oid": "6af73149cda02392e679658c"
    },
    "seedKey": "demo-comment-2",
    "contentId": "6af73149cda02392e6796573",
    "createdAt": {
      "$date": {
        "$numberLong": "1794577705535"
      }
    },
    "text": "This could work brilliantly with a community launch challenge.",
    "userId": "84daef20-e77c-4f9c-9812-7f8b31eb9c3a"
  },
  {
    "_id": {
      "$oid": "6af73149cda02392e679658d"
    },
    "seedKey": "demo-comment-3",
    "contentId": "6af73149cda02392e6796574",
    "createdAt": {
      "$date": {
        "$numberLong": "1794574105537"
      }
    },
    "text": "A shared tool library could be a great first neighbourhood pilot.",
    "userId": "ec644956-b451-4d25-ad25-5c753a31cdb3"
  },
  {
    "_id": {
      "$oid": "6af73149cda02392e679658e"
    },
    "seedKey": "demo-comment-4",
    "contentId": "6af73149cda02392e6796575",
    "createdAt": {
      "$date": {
        "$numberLong": "1794570505537"
      }
    },
    "text": "Short sessions feel much less intimidating for learners. Nice direction!",
    "userId": "84daef20-e77c-4f9c-9812-7f8b31eb9c3a"
  },
  {
    "_id": {
      "$oid": "6af73149cda02392e679658f"
    },
    "seedKey": "demo-comment-5",
    "contentId": "6af73149cda02392e6796577",
    "createdAt": {
      "$date": {
        "$numberLong": "1794566905538"
      }
    },
    "text": "I would join a repair-skills session. This feels genuinely welcoming.",
    "userId": "3162b87e-1e88-45b2-9a04-e749c201ec75"
  },
  {
    "_id": {
      "$oid": "6af73149cda02392e6796590"
    },
    "seedKey": "demo-comment-6",
    "contentId": "6af73149cda02392e6796579",
    "createdAt": {
      "$date": {
        "$numberLong": "1794563305538"
      }
    },
    "text": "Love the focus on realistic routines rather than perfect meal plans.",
    "userId": "3d374004-d812-4fa1-a614-563b14b49884"
  },
  {
    "_id": {
      "$oid": "6af73149cda02392e6796591"
    },
    "seedKey": "demo-comment-7",
    "contentId": "6af73149cda02392e679657b",
    "createdAt": {
      "$date": {
        "$numberLong": "1794559705539"
      }
    },
    "text": "The consent-first idea is important. Families need trust built in from day one.",
    "userId": "84daef20-e77c-4f9c-9812-7f8b31eb9c3a"
  },
  {
    "_id": {
      "$oid": "6af73149cda02392e6796592"
    },
    "seedKey": "demo-comment-8",
    "contentId": "6af73149cda02392e679657d",
    "createdAt": {
      "$date": {
        "$numberLong": "1794556105541"
      }
    },
    "text": "A clear freelancer-focused first version sounds like a strong way to test this.",
    "userId": "75f9826a-1f3a-42ef-95c1-7b602722baeb"
  },
  {
    "_id": {
      "$oid": "6af73149cda02392e6796593"
    },
    "seedKey": "demo-comment-9",
    "contentId": "6af73149cda02392e679657e",
    "createdAt": {
      "$date": {
        "$numberLong": "1794552505542"
      }
    },
    "text": "The local cause connection makes the learning feel more motivating.",
    "userId": "ec644956-b451-4d25-ad25-5c753a31cdb3"
  },
  {
    "_id": {
      "$oid": "6af73d6993480d42857ebf93"
    },
    "contentId": "6af73c4893480d42857ebf92",
    "userId": "3162b87e-1e88-45b2-9a04-e749c201ec75",
    "text": "Live availability and simple reservations could save drivers a lot of time. A map view would make this especially useful.",
    "createdAt": {
      "$date": {
        "$numberLong": "1794588009188"
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "_id": {
      "$oid": "6af73d6993480d42857ebf95"
    },
    "contentId": "6af73c4893480d42857ebf92",
    "userId": "ec644956-b451-4d25-ad25-5c753a31cdb3",
    "text": "The QR-code entry and booking-expiry alerts are thoughtful touches. This could work really well for campuses and shopping centres.",
    "createdAt": {
      "$date": {
        "$numberLong": "1794588009242"
      }
    }
  },
  {
